nix-src slop-optimizations, rebased onto main 8bb6b3514 (v3.23.0) + #572.

Source: https://github.com/DeterminateSystems/nix-src/tree/slop-optimizations
at d5ac293d7. Of its 13 commits, 9 are #572 or already on main. This is the
remaining four, ported to main's per-worker scheduler (pinned fibers,
per-worker fiber limits, no drainQueue()):

  c9eb28086 Executor::drainQueue(): Don't flush the wait lists ...
            Dropped: drainQueue() no longer exists on main.
  cb1ede673 Speculatively evaluate substantial thunks in the background
  ff8f5e183 derivationStrict: Run the background instantiation as speculative work
  95db2e442 Prefetch imports of lists of path literals in the background

Porting changes: the per-worker readyFibers update nrReadyFibers; the
speculative fiber reserve is one slot per worker
(canStartSpeculativeFiber()); failItems() releases the counters of
dropped items; spawnSpeculative() uses main's wake logic and drops work
after shutdown.

